---
/**
 * ============================================================================
 * FOOTER COMPONENT (`Footer.astro`)
 * ============================================================================
 * 
 * ROLE OF THIS COMPONENT:
 * Provides a clean, modern footer anchoring the bottom of the page.
 * 
 * KEY MESSAGING & VALUE PROPOSITION:
 * 1. Privacy Statement: Reassures the user that MicroConvert is a pure client-side
 *    utility with zero file uploads and zero telemetry.
 * 2. Offline Capable Indicator: Highlights that the application works seamlessly
 *    without an active internet connection thanks to the Service Worker.
 * 3. Standard Compatibility: Reminds users of CommonMark & GFM compatibility.
 */
---

<footer class="app-footer">
  <!-- Privacy Guarantee -->
  <div class="footer-privacy">
    <span><strong>MicroConvert</strong> • Client-side document conversion utility. Zero uploads, zero analytics.</span>
  </div>

  <!-- Status & Compatibility Links -->
  <div class="footer-links">
    <!-- Green Offline Status Badge -->
    <span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.35rem; color: #16a34a; font-weight: 500;">
      <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
      </svg>
      Offline Capable
    </span>
    <span>CommonMark + GFM</span>
  </div>
</footer>
